  "title": "Oven Roasted Mediterranean Beetroot Salad",
  "description": "A savory and crunchy Mediterranean salad featuring roasted beetroot, mixed greens, and a tangy dressing, perfect for a light lunch or snack.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
