  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Toss the beetroot cubes with 2 tablespoons of olive oil, salt, and black pepper on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast the beetroot in the oven for 45 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Let the beetroot cool to room temperature.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the mixed greens, roasted beetroot, cherry tomatoes, cucumber, and red onion.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice and remaining 2 tablespoons of olive oil.",
    "Pour the dressing over the salad and toss to combine.",
    "Top the salad with crumbled feta cheese.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
